Mobile MCP + Jev

This experimental fork is based on mobile-next/mobile-mcp, licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. Original attribution and license notices
are retained. This fork is not an official Mobile Next product.

Upstream: https://github.com/mobile-next/mobile-mcp
Base revision: 63a5974d9bfa5b66d1ee4d1b0945df3ebea18b11

Modifications in this fork add optional Jev Android execution, richer Android
observations, OpenCode/GLM runners, benchmark verification, privacy-preserving
measurement exports, documentation, and a fork-specific CI workflow.

The integration design was inspired by browser-use/jev-ultrafast.
